---
layout: null
permalink: /sitemap.xml
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  Sitemap, gated on the `phase0` master switch in _config.yml (DESIGN §9.6).

  While phase0 is true this lists ONLY `/`. jekyll-sitemap's own template lists
  every page it can find, which during Phase 0 means handing Google the whole
  unlaunched site — both device guides, /devices/, /about/, /contribute/,
  /ha-plugins/, /disclaimer/ — with robots.txt pointing straight at it. Marking
  `/` as `sitemap: true` in index.md did not suppress any of that; it only
  described `/`.

  WHY THIS FILE EXISTS AT ALL, AND WHY IT MUST NOT BE DELETED
  -----------------------------------------------------------
  jekyll-sitemap is still installed and still generates robots.txt. Its
  generator is:

      @site.pages << sitemap unless file_exists?("sitemap.xml")
      @site.pages << robots  unless file_exists?("robots.txt")

  so the presence of THIS file is what makes the plugin defer the sitemap to
  us. That is a documented, supported hook — not a hack — but it does mean that
  deleting this file silently hands sitemap generation back to the plugin and
  re-publishes the unlaunched site. script/check-phase0.rb fails the build if
  that ever happens.

  Front-matter defaults (`sitemap: false` per scope) were the obvious
  alternative, but defaults are static YAML and cannot read `phase0` — going
  that route would have meant three independent things to remember at launch
  instead of one flag.
{%- endcomment -%}
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
{%- if site.phase0 -%}
  {%- comment -%} Phase 0: the teaser is the only public page. {%- endcomment -%}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ '/' | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</loc>
  </url>
{%- else -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Launched: every page and device guide whose front matter has not opted out
    with `sitemap: false`. Only trailing-slash URLs are listed, which keeps
    feed.xml, sitemap.xml, robots.txt and CNAME out without an extension
    blocklist.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- for p in site.pages -%}
    {%- unless p.sitemap == false -%}
      {%- assign tail = p.url | slice: -1 -%}
      {%- if tail == '/' %}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ p.url | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</loc>
  </url>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- for d in site.devices -%}
    {%- unless d.sitemap == false %}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ d.url | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</loc>
    {%- if d.last_verified %}
    <lastmod>{{ d.last_verified | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
    {%- endif %}
  </url>
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif %}
</urlset>
